# ==============================================================================
# GARIA RICE MARKETPLACE™ - .gitignore
# Production Git Ignore Rules for Web & Browser-Native Apps Script Development
# ==============================================================================

# 1. SENSITIVE CREDENTIALS & SECRETS (NEVER COMMIT)
*.env
*.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.cert
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets.*
credentials.json
client_secret*.json
service_account*.json
oauth_*.json
token.json

# 2. SPREADSHEET & DATABASE BACKUPS (CUSTOMER PII PROTECTION)
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
/backups/
/exports/
/data_dumps/
dump_*.json
backup_*.json

# 3. GOOGLE APPS SCRIPT LOCAL TOOLING (IF EVER ACCESSED LOCALLY)
.clasp.json
.claspignore
node_modules/
package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# 4. OPERATING SYSTEM ARTIFACTS
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini

# 5. CODE EDITORS & IDE CONFIGURATION
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# 6. LOGS, CACHE & TEMPORARY SCRATCHPADS
*.log
logs/
temp/
tmp/
scratchpad/
*.bak
*.orig

# 7. EXPLICIT PRESERVATION WHITELIST (ENSURE REPO INTEGRITY)
!appsscript.json
!.gitignore
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
